  "_comment": "35 Rochester St (behind 90 W Main): white-grey corrugated-metal pole barn / fleet garage, gable end to Rochester St (-v). Signature: a deep open steel portal-frame canopy (rust-brown posts and rafters) carrying the roof out over the apron, sheltering two big roll-up bays plus a narrower third bay at the right. Light sage-green band along the eaves, light-grey low-pitch metal gable roof, ridge street-to-rear. Plain grey man-door on the NNE side (+u) behind a white vinyl fence. The tan stucco office building on the right (SSW) is the neighbour 248273879 (90 West Main), not this building.",
